  "solution": "Explanation:\n\nWe substitute the values in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) -, ÷, =, -, ×\n\n213 - 67 ÷ 119 = (__**248 - 31**__) × 169\n\n213 - __**67 **____**÷**____** 119**__ = 217 × 169\n\n213 - 0.5 = __**217**____** ×**____** 169\n\n213 - 0.5**__ = 36673\n\n212.5 ≠ 36673\n\nOption 2) +, -, +, ÷, =\n213 + 67 - 119 + __**(248 ÷ 31)**__ = 169\n\n__**213 + 67**__ - 119 __**+ **____8__** = 169\n\n__**288 - 119**__ = 169\n\n169 = 169\n\nOption 3) × ,-, =, +, ÷\n213 × 67 - 119 = __**(248 + 31)**__ ÷ 169\n\n213 × 67 - 119 = __279** ÷**____** 169\n\n213 **____**×**____** 67**__ - 119 = 1.6\n\n__**14271 - 119**__ = 1.6\n\n14152 ≠ 1.6\n\nOption 4) +, -, =, -, ×\n213 + 67 - 119 = __**(248 - 31)**__ × 169\n\n213 + 67 - 119 = __217** ×**____** 169\n\n213 + 67**__ - 119 = 36673\n\n__**280 - 119**__ = 36673\n\n161 ≠ 36673\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 2.**",
